      "sc:description": "Browser-based workspace for sequence analysis and format converters for researchers and students. Homology search, multi-FASTA gene trees, motif and domain correlation, Golden Gate quality control, and sequence format conversion, with a focus on plant pathology and comparative genomics. Guest access — try without signing in.",
